import ../../ui/browser.dl

class:
    patterns:
        key laboratory state
    members:
        finds as an integer
        runs as an integer

appearance page appearance:
    padding is 24
    gap is 16
    font size is 18

appearance source appearance:
    height is 160
    padding is 12
    border width is 1
    border is UI ink 170 180 190

document keyboard laboratory using page appearance:
    text surface "Source" containing "alpha" using source appearance
    button "Run"
    paragraph "Status" containing "Ready" using no UI appearance
    code:
        when the "Source" control receives key 70 with modifiers 2:
            set state to this window's state as a pointer to key laboratory state
            increment state's finds
            set the text of "Status" in this window to (formatted "Find {state's finds}")
        when the "Run" button is clicked:
            set state to this window's state as a pointer to key laboratory state
            increment state's runs
            set the text of "Status" in this window to (formatted "Run {state's runs}")

to [close keyboard laboratory] {a pointer to UI view:view}:
    set instance to view's instance
    set state to instance's state as a pointer to key laboratory state
    close view
    close instance
    destroy the value at state
    deallocate state
    destroy the value at view
    deallocate view
    destroy the value at instance
    deallocate instance

function open keyboard laboratory:
    globals:
        keyboard laboratory
    execute:
        set state to storage for one slot initialized with (a new key laboratory state)
        set instance to storage for one slot initialized with (an instance of keyboard laboratory with state state)
        bind UI key 257 with modifiers 2 from (the control labeled "Source" in instance) in instance activating (the control labeled "Run" in instance)
        set view to storage for one slot initialized with (a UI view of instance sized 800 by 600 using fonts "assets/fonts/NotoSans-Regular.ttf" and "assets/fonts/NotoSans-SemiBold.ttf" with the browser UI driver)
        set view's close action to (the function named "close keyboard laboratory $") as a pointer
        run view

open keyboard laboratory
